{"path":"/zh/patterns/m3-progress-tracking/cases/liangbo/","title":"M3 · 进度追踪 · 东方屹腾执行型 Agent","blocks":[{"block_id":"adps-eece46ad37c07cbe-1","revision":"eece46ad37c07cbe269404c0d933755484819e46d9d3261cefe9f18c142a3a52","tag":"p","quote":"模式矩阵/M3 进度追踪/蓝皮书"},{"block_id":"adps-7fd453ce718e9f2f-1","revision":"7fd453ce718e9f2f81f14710910ddf6962395979f081c89e0e81e5d7f747fd6a","tag":"table","quote":"字段 值 主模式 M3 进度追踪 Progress Tracking（记忆 × 编排） 结合模式 P1 上下文分诊 · M1 分层保留 案例 上海东方屹腾科技 · HR/薪酬 SaaS · 服务 2 万+ 企业 · 执行型 Agent 对应白皮书 /zh/patterns/m3-progress-tracking/ 源 梁博 AICon 逐字稿第六章 · PPT 第 25 页 工程结论 Anchor 固定原始目标，Ledger 追加关键进展，Collection 为当前推理提供按需投影。"},{"block_id":"adps-03cd05685e6ffedd-1","revision":"03cd05685e6ffedd31e76b3392f63f1b3a7157461aeb407e0f4ab58a2eefc442","tag":"p","quote":"东方屹腾的长程任务跨越多个能力边界和十余次模型调用。后续步骤需要持续回答两个问题：用户最初要求什么，系统已经完成什么。"},{"block_id":"adps-a06d9003bebbde08-1","revision":"a06d9003bebbde08fc16f4481903bf7e6c6f242a34c24ed3a8a54fa11a5761d2","tag":"p","quote":"若每一步只继承上一轮叙事输出，原始目标会被中间分析逐步稀释。若完整携带历史，Prompt 会持续增长。进度追踪需要把目标和里程碑外置为可持续读写的状态。"},{"block_id":"adps-63a48e716b4eaafa-1","revision":"63a48e716b4eaafae882d381663de4f033c50e241111d2ca40996dd03dba37a6","tag":"pre","quote":"SessionNarrative Anchor: 原始目标 Ledger: 追加式里程碑事件 Collection: 当前步骤的临时投影"},{"block_id":"adps-f13cd0db38127a3b-1","revision":"f13cd0db38127a3b55ea5d5411dd112c046e1d58cd2e50d9b6f9d193b05f16cd","tag":"p","quote":"Anchor 在任务创建时写入，后续不由摘要覆盖。Ledger 只记录关键变化，例如意图确认、模板匹配完成、快照创建成功、审批等待和任务失败。每条事件保留："},{"block_id":"adps-6aeb098cfb14c2af-1","revision":"6aeb098cfb14c2afc7cfe8b0a52fff540938b57dd9672c4c310a4d001d4fb012","tag":"pre","quote":"event_id task_id event_type summary artifact_ref created_at producer"},{"block_id":"adps-a844cc80d02ebbfc-1","revision":"a844cc80d02ebbfc5841abbb850762d4fe02bd4d8d98fdd7265f34d13d03fe72","tag":"p","quote":"Collection 由上下文分诊模块在关键推理入口生成，不是新的持久化真源。"},{"block_id":"adps-19fd01283b31c18c-1","revision":"19fd01283b31c18cec27753e2aaca977226d0c4b9fd46a1c9968db030995f3c0","tag":"p","quote":"Ledger 采用追加写，历史事件不原地改写。需要纠正时追加更正事件，并引用被更正条目。摘要应说明发生了什么、产生了什么结果、哪些约束仍有效，同时保留指向原始 Artifact 或业务回执的引用。"},{"block_id":"adps-546d353ea19fac71-1","revision":"546d353ea19fac71d612fc0a6701d76cc2e9ecf80370244ca84f918cdfc98f88","tag":"p","quote":"机械参数不以 Ledger 摘要为调用真源，任务节点状态也不从摘要推断。它们分别写入 SessionState 和 Workspace。"},{"block_id":"adps-21f53fe8e2886f86-1","revision":"21f53fe8e2886f86647337c01004ffa3159bc9cfceda5f4fde1de01a3cd730c9","tag":"p","quote":"用户提出薪资组配置目标后，系统写入 Anchor。模板匹配、快照和导入等关键结果依次写入 Ledger。若用户在新一轮只输入“继续”，上下文组装器仍可读取 Anchor，并从 Ledger 选择尚未完成任务所需的里程碑。"},{"block_id":"adps-7b3261d53c83f420-1","revision":"7b3261d53c83f4206238713458224f02272acc8f6fa446654b88dc5e33396c5c","tag":"p","quote":"这套状态也支持中断恢复。恢复过程先读取任务图确定可执行节点，再读取 Anchor 和相关 Ledger 事件恢复语义；API 参数从机械状态平面读取。"},{"block_id":"adps-b451fd034e978fbc-1","revision":"b451fd034e978fbc1cb5e5f04ab03735ecddb0805a6ac1ba98840266593c7266","tag":"li","quote":"目标只存在于首轮消息，没有独立 Anchor；"},{"block_id":"adps-acb9da4809f6092b-1","revision":"acb9da4809f6092bf65bb0ebc84b62ce1cc31002ace80fd322e772481eac9304","tag":"li","quote":"每个内部推理片段都写入 Ledger，导致事件失去里程碑粒度；"},{"block_id":"adps-9126d9d5ed8ca8eb-1","revision":"9126d9d5ed8ca8ebc52bf9a0a19293da8e9c2eb2b7ceb74fff55133c3411e75c","tag":"li","quote":"Ledger 摘要没有原始证据引用；"},{"block_id":"adps-ba6afb490039977d-1","revision":"ba6afb490039977d8fe87d423b6da6ecb3f8def53197ded5631d0c34294ddb31","tag":"li","quote":"历史事件被覆盖，无法还原进展；"},{"block_id":"adps-95cfa031f3d2f000-1","revision":"95cfa031f3d2f000b32261e21f967a36a5544da3e8fd978ed0aab275c720e9cb","tag":"li","quote":"Collection 被持久化后当作完整事实；"},{"block_id":"adps-ba8cb3f492281ed9-1","revision":"ba8cb3f492281ed9a7b2ff5d7c88d7e74746f43b0ab9ed57ad349f4471bdc543","tag":"li","quote":"任务调度和业务参数从自然语言摘要中推断。"},{"block_id":"adps-df360085f4ff3659-1","revision":"df360085f4ff3659426e942b70a6119cc0f2dce0f0935ea8dedaf24d5e8118d8","tag":"li","quote":"后段推理的 Anchor 可用率；"},{"block_id":"adps-58bf156d5b31d6f8-1","revision":"58bf156d5b31d6f8e2fb96990dfd8b3b8a1e5e70ecdbfc1e24c7a9de020e2d2b","tag":"li","quote":"Ledger 事件到 Artifact 或回执的引用完整率；"},{"block_id":"adps-12336e397aca4e66-1","revision":"12336e397aca4e66440fdd32c5f06f2012333e6d3cc6a79142c2264e43c61e2e","tag":"li","quote":"用户输入“继续”后的正确恢复率；"},{"block_id":"adps-fe10865594bfb451-1","revision":"fe10865594bfb45104990aa14e08c1a97b12487932733240670c44d681762cbc","tag":"li","quote":"因目标漂移导致的错误规划次数；"},{"block_id":"adps-e69cceee405c0770-1","revision":"e69cceee405c0770f879ccbcc7725e05f78e471ab08491873895c133fda6acf5","tag":"li","quote":"每个任务的 Ledger 规模和摘要压缩比。"},{"block_id":"adps-ad4bcd9c90cf1fbe-1","revision":"ad4bcd9c90cf1fbeb763aa53bba9185bee943afc1bc7dc0ee700741c1fd8b075","tag":"p","quote":"M3 白皮书把进度追踪定义为 Agent 的外置工作记忆。东方屹腾的 SessionNarrative 提供了具体实现：Anchor 保存目标，Ledger 保存进展，Collection 提供当前读取视图。P1 负责读取侧的投影，M3 负责状态的写入、持久化和恢复。"},{"block_id":"adps-e5223a6311a0d61e-1","revision":"e5223a6311a0d61ea7f67b662f3c63df625b4226dd8ec84bc45d545e0a1e43dc","tag":"p","quote":"当任务跨多轮、多模块或可中断恢复时，应显式维护进度状态。单轮短任务可以直接使用消息历史。若系统尚未区分叙事、机械和调度状态，应先建立状态边界，再引入 Anchor、Ledger 和 Collection。"},{"block_id":"adps-2b93ff9e504bbf64-1","revision":"2b93ff9e504bbf643c39380a4c31fd45e01258b862b386912582df52196efd7f","tag":"p","quote":"引用建议：ADPS、梁博，《东方屹腾 · 进度追踪》，企业 Agent 系统蓝皮书 v0.4，2026-08-02。"},{"block_id":"adps-07336cb1f093d306-1","revision":"07336cb1f093d306f9f6694518f0138fa9925bd53440f26b6e21d427504c348d","tag":"p","quote":"案例报告目录 · 模式目录 · CC BY 4.0"},{"block_id":"adps-79480e7125ad6903-1","revision":"79480e7125ad690354825fcdaaf560618dbc0f310b5df40f3f9e4ed205348fd8","tag":"p","quote":"证据边界：本页是完整案例的模式切片，记录特定系统约束下的实现选择。案例方提供的实现与效果信息未经过独立审计，不构成通用性能承诺。"},{"block_id":"adps-3c551855df185a69-1","revision":"3c551855df185a69bba5e6c436054cab73b1e5df7050f512e066b3f937c0e637","tag":"p","quote":"在 ADPS Chronicle 中查看"}]}
